  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/advancealloygear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nAdvanced Alloy takes all the best parts of its components and combines them together into one metal. While its weapons and armor tend to be rather bulky, they are fantastic when put to test in combat."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/advancealloygear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 4^reset;\n\n高性能 Alloyは、コンポーネントのすべての最高の部分を取得し、それらを一つの金属に結合します。 その武器や装甲はかなりかさばる傾向がありますが、戦闘でテストするときに素晴らしいです。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/aegisaltgear/0",
      "value": "Aegisalt Equipment"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
