      "value": "エージ塩装置"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/aegisaltgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYou've learned to work with the potent crystal Aegisalt to create fantastic weapons and armor."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/aegisaltgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 5^reset;\n\nあなたは素晴らしい武器や装甲を作成するために強力なクリスタルイージソルトで作業することを学びました。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/aetheriumgear/0",
      "value": "Aetherium Equipment"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/aetheriumgear/0",
      "value": "エーテル装置"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/aetheriumgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 7^reset;\n\nThough you only recently discovered what you've dubbed 'Aetherium' alloy, you've already set about weaponizing it in the creation of the literal best weapons and armor known to man, Floran, and everything in between. You'd have to make a pact with an eldritch god to do better than this."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/aetheriumgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 7^reset;\n\nつい最近、「Aetherium」と名付けられた合金を発見されましたが、人間、フロラン、そしてその間にある全てのものにとって知られている、文字通りの最高の武器と装甲の開発で、すでに武器化を試みています。 それ以上に良いことをするには、エルドリッチの神と協定を結ばなければならない。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/ambergear/0",
      "value": "Bee Equipment"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/ambergear/0",
      "value": "蜂の器材"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/ambergear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYou've gotten very good at shaping organic materials, and can now forge hard amber into a variety of bee and honey-themed armors and weapons. (Not by hand, of course!)"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/ambergear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 4^reset;\n\n有機材料を形作るのが得意で、硬いアンバーを蜂や蜂をテーマとした装甲や武器に加工できるようになりました。 (もちろん手作業ではありません!)"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/bioweaponsgear/0",
      "value": "Bio-weaponry"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/bioweaponsgear/0",
      "value": "生物兵器"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/bioweaponsgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nBy applying your knowledge of biology to weapon creation, you've made a variety of weapons that don't just seem to be alive, but are definitely living, breathing murder devices. Though dubiously legal, they are excellent for killing stuff."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/bioweaponsgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 4^reset;\n\n生物学の知識を武器の創造に応用することで、あなたは生きているように見えるだけでなく、間違いなく生きている様々な武器を作りました。 法的なことは疑わしいが、殺すのには優れている。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/bonegear/0",
      "value": "Bonecraft"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/bonegear/0",
      "value": "骨工芸"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/bonegear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nFashioning weapons and armor out of bone is pretty simple, at least compared to metalworking. You can now carve a variety of useful bone-based equipment ^green;by hand [C]^reset;. They might be primitive compared to metal, but they sure beat sticks and stones."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/bonegear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 1^reset;\n\n骨から武器や装甲を造ることは、少なくとも金属加工と比較して、かなり簡単です。 様々な有用な骨ベースの機器を ^green;手[C]で.^reset;. 金属に比べて原始的かもしれませんが、棒や石を叩きます。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/carbonarmorgear/0",
      "value": "Carbon-Fibre Gear"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/carbonarmorgear/0",
      "value": "炭素繊維ギヤ"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/carbonarmorgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nWhen worked properly, Carbon is extremely durable, resistant to elements and very lightweight. You've learned to apply it to the creation of powerful armors. As your skill with weaponmaking grows, Carbon Plating will be the basis of many weapons and armor down the line. It pairs especially well with ^orange;Zerchesium^reset; ore, forming a solid and nearly indestructible cutting edge."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/carbonarmorgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 3^reset;\n\nカーボンは非常に耐久性が高く、元素に強く、非常に軽量です。 強力な装甲の開発に応用することを学びました あなたの武器製造スキルが成長するにつれて、カーボンメッキは多くの武器と装甲の基礎となります。 特に ^orange;ゼルケシウム ^reset;鉱石 とよく結合し、固くてほとんど破壊不可能な刃先を形成します。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/cottongear/0",
      "value": "Cotton-based Armors"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/cottongear/0",
      "value": "綿を使った防具"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/cottongear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've learned how to best apply cotton and plastic polymers in the creation of comfortable and useful armor that will be quite helpful when you're in atmosphere."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/cottongear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 2^reset;\n\n綿とプラスチックのポリマーを最適に組み合わせ、着心地がよく実用的な防具を作る方法を学ぶ。大気のある場所で大いに役立つ。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/default/0",
      "value": "Instructions"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/default/0",
      "value": "操作説明"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/default/1",
      "value": "Select a research by clicking one of the icons on the grid.\nYou can navigate the grid by dragging with the left mouse button.\n\n- The left most button at the upper part of the screen opens a list of research trees to pick from.\n\n- The second button opens a list of non-hidden research options. Click a research on the displayed to center the view on it. Click again to hide the list.\n\n- The third button will center the view on the middle of the tree, or the currently selected research.\n\n- The last button toggles ^orange;low quality mode^reset;. This makes the GUI jump to a position instead of panning to it, or the center button. In addition, dragging/navigating on the the main screen will update only after you release the mouse button. It is best to use the search list with this mode enabled."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/default/1",
      "value": "グリッド上のアイコンをクリックして研究を選択します。\nマウスの左ボタンでドラッグすると、表示範囲を移動できます。\n\n- 画面上部の一番左のボタンで、研究ツリーの選択一覧を開きます。\n\n- 二番目のボタンで、隠されていない研究の一覧を開きます。一覧の研究をクリックすると、その位置へ移動します。もう一度押すと一覧を閉じます。\n\n- 三番目のボタンで、ツリー全体か、現在選択中の研究を画面中央に表示します。\n\n- 最後のボタンは、^orange;低品質モード^reset;の切り替えです。表示位置や中央への移動が、滑らかなスクロールではなく即時切り替えになります。また、メイン画面をドラッグしても、ボタンを離すまで表示が更新されません。このモードでは研究一覧からの検索が便利です。"
    }
  ],
  [
