    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/densiniumgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nAs the heaviest and most generally indestructible metal found naturally, the only thing harder than finding veins of Densinium is forging it. Nonetheless, you've succeeded at this Herculean feat, creating nigh-indestructible and unbelievably powerful armor and weapons."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/densiniumgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 6^reset;\n\n最も重く、最も一般的に破壊不可能な金属は自然に発見され、デンシニウムの静脈を見つけるよりも難しい唯一のことは、それを鍛造することです。 それでも、あなたはこの強気な偉業に成功し、ほとんど破壊不可能で信じられないほど強力な武器と防具を作り出しました。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/durasteelgear/0",
      "value": "Durasteel"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/durasteelgear/0",
      "value": "デュラスチール"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/durasteelgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nDurasteel is known to be tailor-made for use in a vacuum because of its amazing ability to smooth dents and cuts, assuming anything is strong enough to scratch it. Unsurprisingly, it is a great metal to make armor and weapons out of - something you now have the skill to do after much painstaking practice with 'easier' metals."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/durasteelgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 4^reset;\n\nデュラスチールは、真空での使用に最適な素材として知られている。へこみや傷をならしてしまう驚異的な性質があるからだ。そもそも、傷を付けられるほど強い物があればの話だが。武器や防具にも優れた金属であり、「扱いやすい」金属で地道に練習を重ねた今、あなたも加工できるようになった。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/effigiumgear/0",
      "value": "Effigium Equipment"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/effigiumgear/0",
      "value": "エフィギウム装置"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/effigiumgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nEffigium is strange and hard to forge because of its tendency to phase in and out of existence, but it is one of the few sources of the deadly Shadow element. With your skill, you can handle it with ease, putting it to use in some quite fearsome weaponry."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/effigiumgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 5^reset;\n\nエフィギウムは奇妙で、存在の段階的または非存在の傾向のために偽造するのが難しいが、それは致命的なシャドウ要素のいくつかの情報源の一つである。 あなたのスキルで、あなたはそれを簡単に対処することができ、いくつかの非常に恐ろしい武器で使用することができます。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/elduugear/0",
      "value": "Elduu Weapons"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
