  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/irradiumgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nNot only is Irradium far more durable than common isotopes, but its radiation can, uniquely, be contained to an extent. When treated correctly, Irradium will only undergo its deadly radioactive decay when pressure is applied to it, allowing for the creation of weapons that 'discharge' when striking foes but won't slowly fizzle out when stored. It's all around a great way to give your foes cancer in their last moments before death."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/irradiumgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 4^reset;\n\nイラジウムは一般的な同位体よりもはるかに耐久性が高いだけでなく、その放射線は、一義的に、ある程度を含むことができます。 正しく処理されると、Irradiumは圧力がかかると致命的な放射性崩壊を経験するだけとなり、敵を攻撃するときに「発射」するが、保存するとゆっくりと吹き出さない武器を作成することができる。 死ぬ前の最後の瞬間に敵のがんを治すには、とても良い方法だと思います。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/isogengear/0",
      "value": "Isogen Equipment"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/isogengear/0",
      "value": "アイソジェン装備"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/isogengear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nThe fact that Isogen ceaseslessly devours all heat, and somehow remains just above absolute zero, presents an interesting dilemma: how do you forge and work with something like that? Well, you've figured it out with your smart blacksmith brain, and can create the coldest weapons and armor in existence. Not only will they freeze your foes solid, but Isogen armor will let you dive into an ocean of lava and come out no worse for wear."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/isogengear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 6^reset;\n\nアイソジェンは熱を絶えず吸い込み、なぜか絶対零度のわずか上を保っている。では、そんな物をどうやって鍛造・加工するのか？ 鍛冶職人としての知恵で、その難題を解いた。存在する中で最も冷たい武器や防具を作れるようになる。敵を凍り付かせるだけでなく、アイソジェンの防具なら溶岩の海へ飛び込んでも、無傷で戻ってこられる。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/kirhosgear/0",
      "value": "Kirhosi Weapons"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/kirhosgear/0",
      "value": "キルホシ兵器"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/kirhosgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've learned the Kirhos style of weaponmaking - raw power over all else is their philosophy. Kirhos energy guns are very powerful, but prone to overheating."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/kirhosgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 2^reset;\n\nキロの武器製造スタイルを学んだ - 何よりも生の力は彼らの哲学です。 キロエネルギー銃は非常に強力ですが、過熱しがちです。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/lunarigear/0",
      "value": "Lunari Equipment"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/lunarigear/0",
      "value": "ルナリ装置"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/lunarigear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nNow that you can forge Lunari into a usuable form, you can weaponize it. You can now create a large amount of Lunari-based gear."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/lunarigear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 2^reset;\n\nルナリを一般的な形に鍛造できるようになったので、それを武器にすることができます。 ルナリベースのギアを大量に作成できるようになりました。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/monsterplategear/0",
      "value": "Advanced Woven Armors"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/monsterplategear/0",
      "value": "先進のアーマー"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/monsterplategear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYour skill in weaving is matched by few. You can make the best non-metallic armors available and have also learned to work with monster plating to create powerful organic armor."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/monsterplategear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 4^reset;\n\n織る力はほんのわずかです。 最高の非金属装甲を利用可能にすることができ、強力な有機装甲を作成するためにモンスターメッキで作業することを学びました。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/penumbritegear/0",
      "value": "Penumbrite Equipment"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/penumbritegear/0",
      "value": "ペンダンブライト装置"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/penumbritegear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nPenumbrite is a potent metal that holds a sharp edge better than Titanium, making it ideal in many weapons. It alloys with Silver especially well, creating a unique style of weapon that deals damage that is resisted by only a few creatures."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/penumbritegear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 3^reset;\n\nペヌブライトは、チタンよりも鋭いエッジを保持する強力な金属であり、多くの武器に理想的です。 特にシルバーと合金化され、わずかな生き物に抵抗される損傷に対処するユニークなスタイルの武器を作成します。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/prisilitegear/0",
      "value": "Prisilite Equipment"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/prisilitegear/0",
      "value": "プリシライト装置"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/prisilitegear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nFavored by lovers of all things cute for its sparkly, neon appearance, Prisilite is nontheless a very handy crystal in making combat equipment. The sparkling might even be a bonus if you're so inclined!"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/prisilitegear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 4^reset;\n\nプリシライトは、キラキラしたネオンの外観でかわいいすべてのものを愛する人たちに好まれています。それでも、戦闘装備を作る上では非常に便利な結晶です。 スパークリングは、あなたがそんなに傾いているなら、ボーナスになるかもしれません!"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/protocitegear/0",
      "value": "Protocite Equipment"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/protocitegear/0",
      "value": "プロトサイト装置"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/protocitegear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nAlthough Protocite conducts energy well, it is a bit too soft to make melee weapons. Still, it is fantastic as a compliment to ranged weapons and certain armors, which you can now create."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/protocitegear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 3^reset;\n\nプロトサイトはエネルギーをうまく伝導しますが、やや柔らかすぎて、メリーな武器を作ることができません。 それでも、それはあなたが今作ることができる範囲の武器と特定の装甲への褒め言葉として素晴らしいです。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/pyreitegear/0",
      "value": "Pyreite Equipment"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/pyreitegear/0",
      "value": "パイライト設備"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/pyreitegear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nFamed for its tendency to be blazingly hot at all times, Pyreite is as much a danger to its user as it is to foes... were that user anyone but you. With your skill, you can create the hottest weapons and armor in existence, which will not only fry the competition to a crisp but protect you from the worst cold the galaxy has to offer."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/pyreitegear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 6^reset;\n\nパイライトは、常に熱くなっていることで有名です。パイライトは、敵対するのと同じくらいユーザーにとって危険です。 あなたのスキルで、あなたは銀河が提供しなければならない最悪の寒さからあなたを保護するだけでなく、鮮明に競争を揚げることになる存在の中で最も熱い武器と装甲を作成することができます。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/quietusgear/0",
      "value": "Quietus Equipment"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/quietusgear/0",
      "value": "クワイアタス装置"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/quietusgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nQuietus metal is a strange, highly poisonous substance that almost seems to be alive, somehow. Few metals hold a sharp edge like Quietus, making it great in melee weapons. It's also quite potent in armors and ballistic weapons."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/quietusgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 4^reset;\n\nQuietusmetalは、何らかの形で、ほとんど生きているように見える奇妙な、非常に有毒な物質です。 クワイタスのような鋭いエッジを持つ金属はほとんどなく、メリー武器に最適です。 また、装甲や弾道兵器でも非常に強力です。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/silkgear/0",
      "value": "Silk-based Armors"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/silkgear/0",
      "value": "絹製のアーマー"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/silkgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nUsing your knowledge of complex weaving, you can create more powerful textile-based armors that are both practical and fashionable using silk and similar-quality fibres."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/silkgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 3^reset;\n\n複雑な織り方の知識を使用して、絹と同様の品質の繊維を使用して実用的でファッショナブルなより強力な繊維ベースの装甲を作成できます。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/skathgear/0",
      "value": "Skath Weapons"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/skathgear/0",
      "value": "スカース武器"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/skathgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nThe Skath were almost rendered extinct thanks to a long-forgotten enemy, and it has shaped their culture ever since. Skath are quite adept with weaponry, especially plasma."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/skathgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 2^reset;\n\nスカースは長い間忘れられていた敵のおかげでほぼ絶滅し、以来彼らの文化を形成してきました。 スカースは武器、特にプラズマに非常に優れています。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/slimegear1/0",
      "value": "Slime Equipment"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/slimegear1/0",
      "value": "スライム装置"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/slimegear1/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nIt might seem pretty gross, but with some clever engineering you could form solid slime capable of being used as weapons or armor. Don't argue. Just accept.\n\nSome recipes require the ^cyan;Biochemist Table^reset;. Research it in the ^green;Geology tree^reset;."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/slimegear1/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 2^reset;\n\nかなり粗悪に見えるかもしれませんが、巧妙な技術があれば、武器や装甲として使用できるソリッドスライムを形成することができます。 議論するな。 受け入れてください。\n\nいくつかのレシピでは^cyan;生化学者表^reset;が必要です。 ^green;地質学ツリー ^reset; でそれを研究します。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/slimegear2/0",
      "value": "Slime Equipment II"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/slimegear2/0",
      "value": "スライム設備II"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/slimegear2/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nIt might seem pretty gross, but with some clever engineering you could form solid slime capable of being used as weapons or armor. Don't argue. Just accept."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/slimegear2/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 4^reset;\n\nかなり粗悪に見えるかもしれませんが、巧妙な技術があれば、武器や装甲として使用できるソリッドスライムを形成することができます。 議論するな。 受け入れてください。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/slimegear3/0",
      "value": "Slime Equipment III"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/slimegear3/0",
      "value": "スライム設備III"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/slimegear3/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nIt might seem pretty gross, but with some clever engineering you could form solid slime capable of being used as weapons or armor. Don't argue. Just accept."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/slimegear3/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 5^reset;\n\nかなり粗悪に見えるかもしれませんが、巧妙な技術があれば、武器や装甲として使用できるソリッドスライムを形成することができます。 議論するな。 受け入れてください。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/solariumgear/0",
      "value": "Solarium Equipment"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/solariumgear/0",
      "value": "ソラリウム装置"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/solariumgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nSolarium is one of the few things known to the galaxy that is more radioactive than Irradium, and it's extremely heat-resistant to boot. Despite these barriers to working with Solarium, your incredible skill has made weaponizing it downright easy. You can make fantastic, lethal weapons and armor out of Solarium."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/solariumgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 6^reset;\n\n太陽は、イラジウムよりも放射性である銀河に知られている数少ないものの一つであり、それは起動するのに非常に耐熱性です。 ソラリウムで作業するためのこれらの障壁にもかかわらず、あなたの信じられないほどのスキルはそれを完全に簡単に武器化しました。 ソラリウムから素晴らしい、致命的な武器と装甲を作ることができます。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/survival_1/0",
      "value": "Basic Training"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/survival_1/0",
      "value": "基礎訓練"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/survival_1/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYour training, thanks to four years in the Protectorate Academy, provides you with basic survival skills to keep you alive for extended periods in the event of a crash."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/survival_1/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 1^reset;\n\nプロテクター養成学校での四年間の訓練により、墜落事故に遭っても長期間生き延びるための、基本的なサバイバル技術を身に付けている。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/telebriumgear/0",
      "value": "Telebrium Equipment"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/telebriumgear/0",
      "value": "テレブリアム装置"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/telebriumgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've learned how best to utilize Telebrium in the creation of lightweight, poison-themed weapons and armor."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/telebriumgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 2^reset;\n\nテレブリウムを使って、軽量で毒をテーマとした武器や装甲を開発する方法を学びました。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/titaniumgear/0",
      "value": "Titanium Equipment"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/titaniumgear/0",
      "value": "チタン装置"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/titaniumgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nNot too heavy and very resistant to damage, Titanium sees use in all sorts of weapons and armor which are now available for your creation. You can make a variety of weapons and armor that are better than Tungsten."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/titaniumgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 3^reset;\n\nチタンは重すぎず、損傷に非常に耐性があり、あなたの創造のために現在利用可能であるあらゆる種類の武器や装甲での使用を見ています。 タングステンよりも優れたさまざまな武器や装甲を作ることができます。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/triangliumgear/0",
      "value": "Trianglium Equipment"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/triangliumgear/0",
      "value": "トライアングリウム装置"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/triangliumgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nThe natural tendency of Trianglium to form into triangles no matter the circumstance means that it can be used in some very pointy implements. It is also a critical material in handling atomic and subatomic particles, so it's great in energy weapons as well."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/triangliumgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 4^reset;\n\nトライアングリウムの自然な傾向は、状況に関係なく三角形に形成されるため、いくつかの非常に重要な実装で使用することができます。 また、原子粒子や亜原子粒子を扱う上で重要な材料であるため、エネルギー兵器にも優れています。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/tritaniumgear/0",
      "value": "Tritanium Equipment"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/tritaniumgear/0",
      "value": "トリチウム装置"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/tritaniumgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nEven more durable than its constituent Durasteel, Tritanium is very light, very durable, and very resistant to hostile environments. Armor made from Tritanium is among the most readily available source of protection from the ^red;lethal pressure^reset; within gas giants, while its weapons are reliable and very destructive."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/tritaniumgear/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア5^reset;\n\nトリタニウムは、その原料であるデュラスチールよりさらに丈夫で、非常に軽く、過酷な環境にも強い素材だ。トリタニウム製の防具は、ガス巨星内部の^red;致死的な圧力^reset;に対抗できる装備の中でも、比較的入手しやすい。その武器も信頼性が高く、強大な破壊力を持つ。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/tungstengear/0",
      "value": "Tungsten Equipment"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/tungstengear/0",
      "value": "タングステン装置"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/tungstengear/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've learned to work Tungsten like steel in the creation of more advanced forged weapons, armors, and the especially useful ^orange;Breathing EPP^reset;. Besides being generally quite durable when forged correctly, Tungsten also has the heat tolerance to start making useful energy weapons."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/tungstengear/1",
